  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wVx32JG.png\" alt=\"BB\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Пакет ресурсов включает в себя все текстуры, но он постоянно обновляется новыми, исправленными или измененными текстурами.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Некоторые функции требуют Optifine (Настраиваемое небо, Цвета и Связанные текстуры):</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><a style=\"color:#3cc\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://optifine.net/downloads</a></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>(Я не являюсь создателем Optifine, и вам не обязательно его использовать, но некоторые функции моего пакета ресурсов не будут работать без него.)</strong></span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fbitbetterx64%253fgameCategorySlug%253dtexture-packs%2526projectID%253d223591%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253ddhrecuk%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fminecraft.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252fbitbetterx64%253fgameCategorySlug%253dtexture-packs%2526projectID%253d223591%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dBitBetter%2b64x64%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">Поддержать автора, если можете!</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/uWeIeUJ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"967\" height=\"544\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:18px\">СКРИНШОТЫ:</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/FL7htz7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"955\" height=\"537\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/o8wGBxw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"955\" height=\"537\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/t8yRoat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/XI8cyRV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wFMO9QT.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/BhYcLhj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:18px\">ВИДЕО:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1FHSxRNbao1LV686rbYjLw\" rel=\"nofollow\">RSparrow鸿雀</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Nz2KO3gFyeE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCixIlQ2bIUwCNnkFs0krXfQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">OMGcraft - Советы и уроки по Minecraft!</a></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qTkV5nwWdh0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr3_SdkVb_nUIZC5FwVVQRg\" rel=\"nofollow\">FrykeMikeXtra</a></div>\n<div><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2lZxtr8KHkM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC83X2fsfYM9YQIwGCmkVzPw\" rel=\"nofollow\">BereghostGames</a><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/njETcE2CSYE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"63